 "@理性派老王": "@Rational Old Wang",
 "15分钟前": "15 minutes ago",
 "别传撞鬼了。长期熬夜直播的人，心血管出问题太正常了。与其传鬼故事，不如关注直播行业过劳问题。": "Stop spreading the ghost encounter story. For people who stay up late streaming for a long time, cardiovascular problems are completely normal. Instead of spreading ghost stories, we should focus on the overwork problem in the live streaming industry.",
