 "心源性猝死（官方初步判定）": "Sudden cardiac death (provisional official judgment)",
 "发帖：阿凯长期熬夜直播，突发心源性猝死。这不是鬼，是过劳死。": "Post: A-Kai stayed up late streaming for a long time, and died of sudden cardiac death. This is not a ghost, it's overwork death.",
 "\"熬夜猝死\"的说法开始扩散，粉丝群情绪从恐慌转向反思行业问题。": "The claim of \"sudden death from staying up late\" starts to spread. The fan group's emotions shift from panic to reflecting on the problems of the industry.",
 "阿凯不是撞鬼——是熬夜猝死": "A-Kai Did Not Encounter A Ghost — He Died From Staying Up Late",
 "百万粉丝主播长期熬夜直播、高强度带货。深夜直播到凌晨，心率飙升加上精神紧张，心源性猝死不是什么稀奇事。别传撞鬼了，关注直播行业过劳问题。": "A streamer with millions of fans streamed for a long time late at night with high intensity. Streaming deep into the night, heart rate spiking combined with mental stress, sudden cardiac death is not a surprising thing. Stop spreading ghost encounter stories, focus on the overwork problem in the live streaming industry.",
 "说得对。长期熬夜+高强度直播，猝死风险很高。": "Absolutely right. Long-term lack of sleep + high-intensity live streams, the risk of sudden death is very high.",
 "……如果是真的，至少我哥走得没那么邪门。": "... If this is true, at least my brother didn't pass away in a spooky way.",
 "比\"撞鬼\"可信多了。转发。": "Way more believable than \"encountering a ghost\". Forward it.",
 "发帖：阿凯之前的直播带货翻车了，卖假助农产品。这可能是报应。": "Post: A-Kai's previous e-commerce live stream went wrong, he sold fake farmer-help products. This could be karmic retribution.",
 "帖子引发热议，有人开始扒阿凯的带货记录。": "The post sparks a heated discussion, some people start digging into A-Kai's e-commerce streaming records.",
 "阿凯卖过假助农产品——有人因为他死了": "A-Kai Sold Fake Farmer-Help Products — Someone Died Because of Him",
 "阿凯直播间推荐的\"助农直供核桃油\"，实际是勾兑大豆油。有个独居老人买了三瓶，喝了一个月，肠胃出问题去世。家属到现在不知道原因。": "The \"direct farmer-sourced walnut oil\" recommended in A-Kai's live stream was actually blended soybean oil. An elderly living alone bought three bottles, drank it for a month, had gastrointestinal problems and passed away. The family still doesn't know the cause till now.",
 "愤怒的消费者": "Angried Consumer",
 "如果这是真的，阿凯该被追责。": "If this is true, A-Kai should be held accountable.",
