 "都市报发了一篇客观报道，侧重直播行业健康风险和过劳问题。": "City Daily published an objective report, focusing on the health risks and overwork problems in the live streaming industry.",
 "百万粉丝主播猝死——直播行业的健康隐患": "Million-Follower Streamer's Sudden Death — The Hidden Health Risks in the Live Streaming Industry",
 "【都市报报道】知名主播阿凯深夜直播时猝死。专家指出，长期熬夜直播、高强度带货已成为行业普遍现象，心血管疾病风险被严重低估。呼吁行业建立健康保障机制。": "[City Daily Report] Renowned streamer A-Kai died of sudden death during a late-night live stream. Experts point out that long-term overnight streaming and high-intensity e-commerce streaming have become a widespread phenomenon in the industry, and the risk of cardiovascular diseases has been severely underestimated. Call on the industry to establish a health guarantee mechanism.",
 "终于有正规媒体报道了。": "Finally a formal media has covered this.",
 "业内人士": "Industry Insider",
 "这个行业确实需要规范了。": "This industry really needs to be regulated.",
