 "路过主播小区那晚，我在想什么": "What Was I Thinking The Night I Passed The Streamer's Community",
 "那晚路过主播住的小区，感觉整栋楼都不对劲。后来才知道是主播猝死了。不是闹鬼——是这个行业把人逼到极限了。每天熬夜直播到凌晨，身体不出问题才怪。": "That night when I passed by the community the streamer lived in, I felt the whole building was off. Only later did I find out the streamer died from sudden death. It's not haunting — this industry has pushed people to their absolute limits. Streaming every day late into the night, it's abnormal if the body doesn't break down.",
 "说得太对了。不是鬼，是行业问题。": "Absolutely right. It's not ghosts, it's the industry's problems.",
