 "地方报纸·旧闻存档": "Local Newspaper · Old News Archive",
 "事件发生当年": "The Year the Incident Happened",
 "【旧闻】紫藤巷旧案：一名学生外出求助后返回现场": "[Old News] The Wisteria Lane Old Case: A Student Went Out For Help Then Returned To The Scene",
 "两名初中女生放学后绕行一条开着紫藤花的小路。事发后，其中一名女生翻过巷尾矮墙，跑到大路向路人求助，并随报警的路人返回旧巷。同行的另一名女生随后被送往医院，最终未能救回。报道对未成年当事人作了匿名处理。": "Two junior high school girls took a detour down a small path full of wisteria flowers after school. After the incident, one of the girls climbed over the low wall at the end of the lane, ran to the main road to ask passersby for help, then returned to the old lane with the passerby who called the police. The other girl with her was later sent to hospital, but ultimately could not be saved. The report anonymized the underage parties involved.",
 "当年的街坊": "Local Neighbor Back Then",
 "记得那个跑来求助的孩子。她一直说，朋友还在里面。": "I still remember that kid who ran for help. She kept saying, her friend is still inside.",
 "本地论坛·历史存档": "Local Forum · Historical Archive",
 "【求证帖存档】请找回旧巷事件的完整经过": "[Verification Post Archive] Retrieve the Full Story of the Old Lane Incident",
 "有路人回帖确认：外出求助的女生没有独自离开，而是带着人返回了现场。旧帖提到，两名女生当时都没有手机，求助者在大路上才找到愿意帮忙的人。请保留完整记录，不要只截取“翻墙离开”几个字。": "A passerby replied to confirm: The girl who went out for help didn't leave alone, she brought people back to the scene. The old post mentions that neither of the two girls had a phone with them at the time, the one seeking help only found someone willing to help on the main road. Please keep the full record, don't just intercept the words \"climbed over the wall and left\".",
 "当年回帖": "Old Reply Back Then",
 "她回来过。把后半段删掉，事情就完全变样了。": "She came back. Delete that second half of the story, and the entire story becomes completely different.",
 "地方报纸·后续存档": "Local Newspaper · Follow-Up Archive",
 "事后跟进": "Follow-Up Report",
 "【后续】旧巷事件处理与当事人近况": "[Follow-Up] The Old Lane Incident Resolution and The Parties' Recent Situation",
 "后续存档记录了相关人员获刑的消息。事件中的另一名女生此后随家人转学，离开了当地。现有资料没有附完整判决书；具体罪名、各人刑期与执行时间不在这份摘录中。": "The follow-up archive records the news that the relevant people were sentenced to prison. The other girl involved in the incident later transferred schools with her family and left the local area. No full judgment document is attached to the existing materials; specific charges, each person's sentence length and execution time are not included in this excerpt.",
